# Netlify redirects.
#
# One canonical host only — serving the site on both the apex and the www
# subdomain splits ranking signals between two URLs for the same page.
https://www.torealco.tn/*  https://torealco.tn/:splat  301!

# No SPA catch-all on purpose: every route is prerendered to a real file,
# so unmatched URLs fall through to 404.html with a genuine 404 status
# instead of answering 200 with the homepage (a soft 404).
